{
  "id": "c8d9ec6305ec626294a79cfe",
  "title": "忍者神龟3",
  "summary": "童年阴影系列，微笑继续。本篇又名：一块披萨引发的回忆。 这是当年包机房里的大热门游戏。名字有点歧义，甚至我20年前写《激龟忍者传》时的认知都是错的：日版是忍者神龟2，美版因为把激龟忍者传也算了进去，所以是忍者神龟3，盗版一般盗的是美版，所以也应该算3。 这次的阴影不少人也能猜到：打不死的斯雷德。当年游戏开发商为了防止盗版，给游戏上了特殊的加密。最有名的就包括一碰就死的《外星战将》，第二关BOSS不死的《特救指令》和本作，第六关BOSS不死的《忍者神龟3》。显然，一碰就死和第二关过不去属于早死早升天的爽快死法，其伤害性远远小于打了一个多小时之后第六关过不去。 故事放到我身上，是加了料的： 话说我大爷1991年秋天的时候再婚，大娘是寡妇带了个儿子。白捡的堂哥属羊头，我属猴屁股，他大我20个月，差不多两岁，高我一届…",
  "content": "<p><a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/33e729fdd952d255fc36f377c1155f5c033bcc72f591a2e5127ab4aed2e00e5391acc91290c75bac362b9bd914d51ae0f94adaeb2b9b9a5f91ba889193ac8973\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">忍者神龟3：曼哈顿计划</a></p>\n<p>童年阴影系列，微笑继续。本篇又名：一块披萨引发的回忆。<br>\n这是当年包机房里的大热门游戏。名字有点歧义，甚至我20年前写<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/10aa77c7fef33a34ef7f74ebf3eb9ee37031b4863feeccda6b681d93c1ba154d19a61a168aaf301e5ca8b9d07470eeba681fccc590eb76e326a89738d291cba14c72a2b8891c\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">《激龟忍者传》</a>时的认知都是错的：日版是忍者神龟2，美版因为把激龟忍者传也算了进去，所以是忍者神龟3，盗版一般盗的是美版，所以也应该算3。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/3b9cdbb6f0e95a99f1af4d886ea39927254664b1756a4d53d16f5483a1b29a75fe12209f6e5a3aded675c52f943218b4e48899f71e63db533eda0ba01214c2dcf55d5f9a7887f126036cb6a5f88534089b5a85e1e6c69249ee63b480761fa2bd54ba890aa4d446f027005c215698b21899d4cf415ed640d2\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_000\"></a></p>\n<p>这次的阴影不少人也能猜到：打不死的斯雷德。当年游戏开发商为了防止盗版，给游戏上了特殊的加密。最有名的就包括一碰就死的《外星战将》，第二关BOSS不死的《特救指令》和本作，第六关BOSS不死的《忍者神龟3》。显然，一碰就死和第二关过不去属于早死早升天的爽快死法，其伤害性远远小于打了一个多小时之后第六关过不去。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/544dc65f29da862bcfa94b0cc500be4083f04b27b705287467aef445c94045136179450f99d476a8c3eff3d3558df65c8cdcfa0628bd36dd743f7a888c8df14597ebe3b4bde0318dbbefd47985111e65cd1b7ef369b56e92e94939b58b8106c1ba28153629c4fcd45c977270414bc40157ca594ce656e9d1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_001\"></a></p>\n<p>故事放到我身上，是加了料的：<br>\n话说我大爷1991年秋天的时候再婚，大娘是寡妇带了个儿子。白捡的堂哥属羊头，我属猴屁股，他大我20个月，差不多两岁，高我一届。<br>\n大娘很快发现我妈是奶奶家这边的话事人，就千方百计讨好以达成间接讨好我妈的目的。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/c51a137d60b052c843c8431c03740703cdb47755c38a27b2a19049b91b00f664d2a01d57f0e288f59226827a8e41bfe3d3a3416fd1c9013272f1ac4a2d2cd7d8ab46bdae88f6372613d3486c0172d6a190f5739cd8904c28dff8781d7ae6707edddc42a137b16b45f3d128dcc8bdeb2a2339bd1e3f6ee7ec\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_025\"></a></p>\n<p>1993年小升初暑假，我照例被寄存在奶奶家。某天，二手堂哥忽然来找我，要我去他家玩。<br>\n他说的“家”是我大娘自己原来的房子，离我大爷大娘那个万人大厂很近，离市区很远。<br>\n我犹豫了3秒就答应了。对我来说最大的吸引力在于，没大人管。二手堂哥那时不喜欢和我大爷住一起，准初二了而且是放假期间，吃饭只需要直接进厂去找我大娘。他是一个人住的。<br>\n此外他们家不光有厂内的闭路电视看，还承诺了要请我打电游。<br>\n他请我打的正是《忍者神龟3》。他们厂子那一带穷乡僻壤，电游厅（包机房）单价也便宜，1块钱40分钟。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/07411b5f5e67370f5cad9a4e3d26f478c6d3349a62a7fd81f4600df219785b60b91739c36c993a73a8d7eccb2b82761e12908b1ecf017c29a8f2f498ada9151d2887398a9e5ce8eb6f2254a6565f14cfc04eaa3d56fdafac808666c77e15df21cca9d284477d5140b3624ce01520683e550a8da5f1001c7b\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_005\"></a></p>\n<p>防盗版机制令游戏难度直接变成HARD，敌人都变得皮糙血厚。他花第3块钱的时候我们才见到斯雷德。等我俩打了十几分钟斯雷德还打不死的时候，老板提示说时间要到了，并且友善提醒：这个斯雷德是打不死的，别白费力气了。<br>\n这时旁边有位观战的大哥忽然冒出一句：“只有打斯雷德之前一个馅饼（回血道具）都不吃才能把他打死。”<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/c092d8799cd5c7c9841ffbe8f0adf9d822560a023c0090be54ebc05f7942f3e85a91fd282990beb94f37af72a7e77dec689dda27fd86c576cd39cd891dbe7ebceae9b706408c93cf8f82c85c8b6678f1a18342ffc2c17b8f2e4753b68983e3287bb474ba732df4e7ccbe5c257b677d1ffed6b130b3cb92d3\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_030\"></a></p>\n<p>第二天回家之后我妈因为我跟“外人”走了把我臭骂一顿。并且要求我找机会请二手堂哥玩点什么，不能占他便宜。<br>\n1993年的中秋节是9月30号。中秋节自己家聚会，第二天有远房亲戚来看望我奶奶。于是第二天的时候就拉他回请，继续玩《忍者神龟3》。<br>\n我奶奶家附近的包机房是正常的1块钱30分钟，但好运气，是30条命的hack版。这次花了4块钱。小心翼翼的不碰馅饼，结果涛声依旧。<br>\n不吃披萨也不能打死BOSS这件事让我直接龙场悟道：“爱科学，传谣不信谣。”<br>\n这也是为什么后来我在电游厅为什么能顺嘴说出“<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/877a46dffae64dfc071b0657974d6db0a07a2105deb15b352f5dd581385e52611cc0d493c2ee5d9e4f32769176ce5331a4648f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">黑暗海豹</a>”去忽悠别人。既然吃了亏，就要拉更多的人进坑。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/5626fa09495a3fd2c2c92e2d8ee4f4fdabb6fc5f64c0dd0aa7c08d648431d2cc059a8b50f22a74b32cf19b99111353993153183f963787a63f45cae9d0bfb13e4924dfd1bc48c10a4cd427a1a2c45ba5a869828350d4797179593a1487b75376ff548d49c96b3d05f0ddfab86233fd93cc3cef5ccada355a\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_013\"></a></p>\n<p>要说当年就真的没有通关的方法了吗？倒也未必。除了有可能出现的正版卡以外，也有传闻，使用“魂斗罗30条命秘技”是可以选关的，把斯雷德跳过去不就行了。我和二手堂哥也都各自实验了一下，都没成功就放弃了。现在得知真相：《忍者神龟3代》美版选关秘技是<strong>↑↑↓↓←→←→AB</strong>，而我是熟练精准掌握魂斗罗秘技的，只按BA完事，二手堂哥是冗余派的BABA，我们都没按错，也不属于另外一个ABBA的错误派别，所以就一步之遥咯。<br>\n小马过河是世界上最好的寓言，只不过验证这件事，是要付出成本的。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/a399751b5179fb48201ecd44d718a620ad9c9d2cbd77e173c50632202a6ec9600c279a4dad972c3280299e4a16aff209646bea1f9446036818bd71ceaafef0deebe96a1dbc1cc7ff4eef74a1eecf673042cab9e77e627e0436c0cd2dcf53b1d980f7191f887d9192429b2eac0f87bb6a66318297cddaf2a8\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_018\"></a></p>\n<p>说回游戏。本作日版发行于1991年，美版是1992年，FC发展到此时已经是大成阶段，所以这款游戏在画质音乐都非常优秀，游戏性和趣味性比前作更是强出一大截。最大的特色是设计了不同的“绝招”代替之前的“扇脸蛋子”。最好用的依旧是达芬奇，双刀可以封线且多打BOSS几次；其次是多纳泰罗（爱因斯坦），翻滚攻击多段输出；拉斐尔的绝招类似街霸里警察的“窜电”，出招快，连打带跑，安全性高；米开朗基罗的绝招最差，出招慢且主要对空，适用范围极逼仄。<br>\n发这种大招是要掉血的，不过扣到最后一滴血就不会再扣了。由此也诞生了动作游戏小白最普遍的玩法：只要不停放大招就好。这种玩法有两个缺点，一是被碰一下就挂了；另一个是，因为绝招并不是两个键无脑同时按下，而是要先点一下跳在几帧之内再按拳，所以非常累手。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/6c84bef2ddc78db5cff62548412d44e3c0d9e33f7bf2d5bc6bf527e79333f91a92d3056077c76fde48004925d59d2a0139bc67a375de7a75898c6dc63e93315c8513297bae8d12cc9ff0b70b67e4927069cb97f47ba9e58940ca37cdc2851b63214cb14c3734d9ade5c317b7ecb18554d7d9c3a7be0b7576\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_007\"></a></p>\n<p>高端的玩家玩法要优雅很多，他们用的是另一个新出的招式“下挑”，一般的福特兵一下一个。这招也非常累手，这回累的是左手。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/cad39b22cd822c885c45500d1bb84c6fd7228d2c81982ab5327fc7b880dae503af2be7fba78c58ce1b185a7be50582f7f371d38d6d44c482ad96c5e3d465c4765135286dc137fbfd53d35993b3ad5287a3eaa549a0e50f7463db2d072f79d698efee3b498068a8fe1e1025bd3fcf4f78413a13d63c688083\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_006\"></a></p>\n<p>科纳米这次把福特兵的种类设计得异常丰富，长枪、铁桶、鞭子、铁砧、回旋镖，甚至还有专门扬沙子的。尤其倒数第二关有个电梯场景，所有敌人拉出来遛一圈，挺带感的。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/a637c8b78a16b7f349c30649d65bb6634ff0bc5754262ce826b82971c6ec57246021bd0afd7c39c2e4d21c599f70bd0fd7771d71e10d1f40a97627859aaba7bc5aa59ed7aac195f26eb37d1c4a1325c2d77771816a827fbd033957b86e2b6dab5dec8d9872898be4842089215bfe155bfe7fe5dbf277290c\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_032\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/46d31a82fd03f0caceed1366a7fdfe7d488f60447f24b79d8f2dbdfc7b0d0d1e0b27bce0f9eb5e2c7a032d81da2c83da27eec854f54a3117c7e73d5cb855e5fa7d4d585d1c6184589b984480855183475aa01a1582318ddf9cf072efc0c0c117d5b14c9f57b3489649792d2e6feb663eb02bfa99a2bf81b7\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_023\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/f67527259901dbf63fdcc66ab003c03bb0b43e4ccc0d5f66ceaf2e477455ce5a886de3575c314779e0fa18eab08d9198414ae43d237c05ebeba44787dbad1d6048d139f0879848cf26f67998c9db0befb7948e08be8d51b90243fd9e0c4bd8b743576243ae538d381e12977884a0713ea95e38d91985b5e7\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_020\"></a></p>\n<p>与之对应的，乌龟的受伤方式也很丰富，被压扁被束缚被电击，统计这玩意儿多少有点受虐狂了。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/aa74d9e5e0a6e7872cc828bb02066cde15d58b5e74e321865a70356a63b2894525249bc860a6a1ca1fa4a43b633b53606109956c2eda8166bae6d0c1a4507f821974d97c981240d58f371ed71a138a74cbb12228f8abe9f1d37222e9a23bc43f55431326e5b3597ca3e831602fb782fd093ddd5054e9a3f3\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_010\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/b6a25cddfb44e914cc01369472bbdcbae7166137f3f3f769a8481132a9db67dce3e96b0b44602c595500489c905ff975bb2755b3b4c3730fd4c91d81bddc94bc2be7ab7efd1afc5c82e643ecb6915dcce92a99bfc10527e8dec3601798088fcb4f05780d8f9b155c3a1ceb46adcf4d0150962235bd0be885\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_031\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/93f4a7b07686f637a3b3a5581e713e846c06ec354f0493753d45263326cd472cd38a84a112d277548c84898d9c808ba081aea0047c7d8690f54b54937c3015a171c330c6667f1cea371405bf3ad68cb5e51f4a3845311a6fe73200164624e33b7fa2a547ef4d98509b39db08f5c0e62c0c024dd90b05eac1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_033\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/ad1c9ca814a072c3f90f9d5db3ba5f94353391e58b9403f643b32ee5d838ae0716f7cd99a3e15c58bd1b114bf7c8a9940a863392eb8e10930bcef5183229584e78f211bdf2b181ca76033b56ef02cafb1f53a3638191ba2bb3f341edf7acabb563307fdaf6326e670d729ea20c57f13f24d83760a88a0149\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_019\"></a></p>\n<p>故事方面好像是原创的，但也有说法是基于一个动画版改的，不管怎样都平平无奇。反正爱普莉儿又双叒叕被斯雷德抓走了。这次斯雷德和朗格玩了个大的，把整个曼哈顿搞成了个空岛，有种X-MEN电影的既视感。这也是副标题《曼哈顿计划》的由来。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/8f931ccdf4afbb4c8ba96851351130927145bf2683909aee7c97c32432beab893b9604220a92b18b1aa7ba4756265b32efb7a4777a46e26c05515ffe2847a9c3143429e63c0b442606df4ffefbc20d4a95c9c7d2bfb3f73e90400497e20039767d8333273fca00d43f595a24087d489110f3aead4eada4d7\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_002\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/539f080939242b04c89da41e4dba2a553ed967d1afee3cb582a1bd8872f13fd8a914736b3185f176c56e08075ff5b4d83a6985d6c52bbebf712c6ce789866f67c053a2c3387afdad4bf8ef7600b93f1abe1b5c73f673e3659e6a6466e4c5df6139cd07554b5f130e98ebc997722aa253bba2848f505f64eb\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_001\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/a709bd3273dd967a06e03f9764bd5f7e3d2820e166acc71c3212035beecd16499293f035ee0bb4561377bec4939e2749d52a2a2f23d60b0c9921a580657c00cf8444ebbc73741e2119551f75c30ed59ba6605b51f931ec59d70247655ed1f51a3ec6d160af99c2d34a3fe8b0bae1b31a3cbaf461e72c2076\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_040\"></a></p>\n<p>前面几关BOSS除了牛头猪面这俩熟人，还有很多机械怪和变异怪，不少关卡还设置了些不咬人膈应人的中BOSS，不求要命命但求费血那种。其中见到斯雷德之前最难的是第五关的鳄鱼，甩尾巴那一下又快又狠。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/eed42153508de09bc4eac9f33100f827d254c90436a06f0a8099a9cd92aa9bef4e4be1cb16bc21af8aa16141c203073f508f2aad56c9ac7d20cf360458fbabe39b59a356c0d739af240c7da47b99b7f90e9957ca45c10e09a0a30a9a57efca76a06968bfab39cdf68557f5fee2c8abf1a41abc88d6ab6f1d\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_004\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/d83b12c8b583c0f29bf22a71f5965fcce6466fbabe2ab11b7826b6ff2ce4a1ce9390ec7776b961d46b97b5c921e4cbaeaf24739a71640ae8c1788fc11c07c72b9594cc6dc0d97d5b32ae28b3ebafd110ef8d61dbfe47dd61d759e9dcfc4ddda846927135e15de60e961aac056db283b21d1d5114d8c90052\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_008\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/fefb42e55eb3f66abae00360dab3a3f751bb57785a43f8055c68446ed7befd25a08fe84d95d3faf97715304f7047abf22a7ed73c040437aefe05b7aec6757f8c053ef1a30118003950117f5c47ba6ab393b1a154d988fdf295a06ded9b3401a5b3bd76b324323c8d3335b137800c3b762af195e88ac9911d\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_012\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/1de4bb7ca9a71bef0db98f3835d7b1824ad7413fb9214124267f8f34e4a141bbd69941cb77d21b6570b52e2c60945e60a6e950d19754f931a664f151eace9958b9f55d7dbb72c565378a19f11001da30b1f88a1899cb7816eeb255d8c38abf2dd948f1c0444a6ec3b7cb60925a6353009a6decb4f5aa2b42\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_015\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/2ac23feb64e887ffa12d1b82e65bcbf280376e2e1ac966d3a10b55988cc1c27b4e7a3623b90d71516951ca86a5543f226b262e57eb24f4a6d4f5e258186a8f1490e0a3825cd1c37f5227bdace1e52da951bb75f2d0238914a0a625d13302b1d105fc41f90fd0fddf6d687a4469fca5537dfc4b052f07298d\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_021\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/48eec838a4918dc8d8dcc0632fb3b36a61418d28756b43d3a09153b9fc003182bae05287bd06d7d698625319ce5c975f4cef46120d40df63ded8fa1843cc6900477d17d25d5c6ce3ef828aaa47e7089ef9a676d03423aca8af3d93\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_024\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/2577829be1ff583eb026f065ea003bb4ab64c1ea58a7259933deb041a25ac4ae4e473dc9e04170173527a00a802d8e768fdcbf8c393255ef2f976893468d914001920f526fdce10f0609fa8eb99005d53ba5255f77bd373b17950d5246b27eeb7893b0dfd7ff38d613f706dfe431270b06b3ef527a1fd293\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_026\"></a></p>\n<p>下面就是打不死的斯雷德了。其实正常打不怎么难，压迫感甚至还没有上一代强。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/d0dd78ab6e2659b1b0e9e76fdce144b7cc1d45232809d97ba8eb9d212147877d6fa0b37d7cf018b90e3a4b3189edb62f3e3c63ac610ac4c998e383b8bc56f6a7fd0673d8a763baf134348138a4d43a291ed8477e80ae93654bc2dd2d78f3bb65c1511483435b61c7038f9a89d1ff45f819b200f9c4631d46\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_027\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/511e94be1b7b0499f1150f604a4479c3d050318cd9428b2eb53913b8dee21853e22e37eb959e3d753c29d24d5d73f60ec6dbcb206045e7e4670280267d1deb4c9e9d99b92da0da08602b482fc1dbb6ae36e851840cfbd7700a8922090a62307e56137c425289e56c66d27e5fda1c1d1ea2178fcddc9a8517\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_028\"></a></p>\n<p>打完斯雷德之后还有还有两关，守关的是朗格和变异斯雷德。难倒是没多难，只是流程相当的长，打到这会儿注意力都下降了，手更是要搓出腱鞘炎了。以我这臭手当年5块钱都不一定能兜住底。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/8a7a914ea8a52ef410fab689f84066d94fcbd1bf3855536afa115d2552dc61e0c90d668565161978b32ee5007124b71f6e385cb5b6092c8630d98448d7c2c987d515f4bfc10adc7fb74482e939a0e55be7e4948912ae6c5e98a9dbf1bcb29b9406bbfb6bbff834131cdd66b95face45465c95939e6ffde67\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_029\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/0e87ce7773e0bf7454ffb9986346aabd035eb8f7353b47afd0e0644164c26aaa2a9845450352e28fa42730d326bed518ba33527fbeea1da9a1174c655d1640b7ab71f97eb85b50180beeddf443726b1c41e338d2876776c7b1ff83cc6c9a737c97d3e3ec1326db203abfee8fb8850e137ab67ad3d6bd82b8\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_034\"></a></p>\n<p>守关的斯雷德，形象莫名有点像《幽游白书》里的武威，技能是操控雷电，不过他放雷电大招的时候也是破绽最大的时候，抓机会一顿猛放大招就行。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/02534bc3b5a798ed052a61ff9fad00fd8393c453fddb2ac0169380f2f4787447b19ba13227c8503833dbec5b549d3198f1979bf51cd4fe0fa4325b6f96ac54e3b3eb5f37f3ce7cd89b7dfec6f325489673d110aa51a9afefd2496528eae6bea3b97fa72e2ce5b50483537cddd59a50654d72a99fb15fd735\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_037\"></a></p>\n<p>通关！<br>\n怨念退散！<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/28a3e8ed5691932d996f098f3f34e1f1e59b34acdfd11735a5cd19a170c684b5799e6d7c3886fa8670c37debe4455b892724b8097211512a9b34ff33047fbd44ea688dce5e8fa2a2be39a5a355e2c11a1fea60214a37046794bea516b43951fefb1f82cfa6d28935076a2f035ba2e9d8a73b9cdbed9317ba\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_038\"></a></p>\n<hr>\n<div>\n<ul>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">(1)</a>：别问为啥用千问，问就是88VIP快到期了，不愿意多注册国产服务。</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div><span>《<a href=\"https://pewae.com/2026/10/teenage-mutant-ninja-turtles-iii-the-manhattan-project.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">忍者神龟3</a>》采用<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">署名-非商业性使用-禁止演绎</a>许可协议进行许可。 『<a href=\"https://pewae.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">破袜子</a>』期待与您交流。</span><div><div><h3>相关推荐:</h3><ul><li><a href=\"https://pewae.com/2024/09/mega-man-3.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">洛克人3</a><span>[47%]</span></li><li><a href=\"https://pewae.com/2009/05/e7bb9d-e68b9b.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">绝招</a><span>[43%]</span></li><li><a href=\"https://pewae.com/2006/07/teenage-mutant-ninja-turtles.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">激龟忍者传</a><span>[42%]</span></li><li><a href=\"https://pewae.com/2007/07/altered-beast.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">兽王记</a><span>[34%]</span></li><li><a href=\"https://pewae.com/2015/12/night-night.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">天天天黑</a><span>[33%]</span></li></ul></div></div></div>",
